ode_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-15T22:07:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T10:01:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.6, 4.6.1, and 4.7.dev2\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 42 Linux\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Godot 4.6 or earlier, one could use `EditorInterface::edit_resource`, and the `EditorInspector` would be populated with all the properties by calling `_parse_property` on all relevant `EditorProperty` handlers, including those for third-party plugins. This behavior did not depend on whether the Inspector tab or the Signals or Groups tabs were focused.\n\nIn Godot 4.7, this behavior has changed. Now, the pre-Godot 4.7 behavior occurs only when the Inspector tab is focused. When the Inspector tab is not focused, none of the Inspector editor plugins or their respective `EditorProperty` handlers are called.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a custom `EditorInspectorPlugin` and `EditorProperty`.\n2. Call `EditorInterface::edit_resource` on a resource object.\n3. Observe that `_parse_property` is called when Inspector tab is focused, and isn't when it the tab is not focused.\n\nOn Godot 4.6, the method is called in (3) in both use cases.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117458/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117458/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}